Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly
Description: unofficial NetEase Cloud Music player for Linux
 A native GTK player that talks to the public NetEase Cloud Music web API.
 It does not wrap the website and does not use Wine.
 .
 This package is unofficial and is not affiliated with NetEase.
 Login, playlists and audio quality follow the account permissions
 returned by the service. Architecture is all, so the same package
 installs on x86, x86_64 and ARM Debian-family desktops.
